5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I believe we should prioritize stability and external dependencies. I will look into the winter road closures north of the river and the quoted delivery windows from suppliers.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I want to make sure everyone can actually get to us! I'll look into the bus links in the two outer wards and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I'm concerned about the long-term sustainability of our funding. I will look into the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines from last year.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I think we often ignore our own history. I'll look into the two programmes begun six years ago and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use to see what actually works.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I want to make sure we have the right people to help. I'll look into the volunteer register and supervision training, and the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
