12,1,2,talk,George,,I agree. We have a balanced approach. I see no reason to change our selections; let us proceed and see what the records reveal.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I'm perfectly happy with this. It's much better to actually check the records than to just guess based on who speaks the loudest in the room. Let's get to it.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
