64,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Based on our findings, Candidate A is the most viable. It utilizes partner organizations, avoiding the unreliable contractors of B, the tool certification issues of C, and the budget and road risks of D.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"Candidate A sounds perfect! It uses partners to reach people across the district, which means we can finally help those in the outer wards who lost their bus links without needing a risky vehicle.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,1,talk,George,,"Candidate A aligns with our financial constraints. By coordinating with partner organizations, we avoid the heavy operating costs of a vehicle and the risk of a budget collapse once the initial grants expire.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,1,talk,May,,Candidate A is the only one that doesn't ignore history. We've already seen that partner-run groups survive while digitisation fails. It's a proven model that doesn't rely on us micromanaging everything.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think Candidate A is the best choice. Since it uses partner organizations and facilitators, it won't put too much pressure on our staff, and we won't have to worry about the tool certifications.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,It is rare that we reach such a consensus so quickly. Every other option presents a risk we have already identified as critical. Candidate A is the only logical choice for long-term stability.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm just so happy we found a way to help everyone! Candidate A lets us be there for the people who need us most while keeping things sustainable. I'm definitely voting for it!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,2,talk,George,,I concur. Candidate A avoids the pitfalls of the other options and ensures we do not overextend our operating budget. It is the most responsible choice for the library's future.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,2,talk,May,,It's refreshing when the evidence is this clear. We're choosing a model that actually works in the real world rather than a fancy-sounding project that will just gather dust. I'm voting for A.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I feel much better now that we've talked it through. Candidate A seems like the only one that won't overwhelm the staff or create safety risks. I'll vote for A too.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Since we have all identified the same risks and found a single solution that mitigates them all, there is no reason to deviate. I will cast my vote for Candidate A.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm with you! I'm so glad we're doing this. I'm voting for Candidate A!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,3,talk,George,,I agree. Candidate A is the only proposal that ensures fiscal stability and avoids the recurring budget shortfalls I have observed. I cast my vote for Candidate A.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,3,talk,May,,I'm in complete agreement. It's the only option that respects the data and our history. I cast my vote for Candidate A.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with everyone. It's the safest and most supportive option for the staff. I cast my vote for Candidate A.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,"The consensus is absolute. We have weighed the logistical, financial, and human risks and found Candidate A to be the only sustainable path. I am satisfied with this decision.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
