83,3,4,talk,George,,I am satisfied as well. We have made a prudent decision that balances community needs with financial reality. I believe this will serve the library well for years to come.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
