85,3,4,talk,May,,It's a rare win for common sense. We're actually learning from the past instead of just repeating it. I'm glad we stuck to the facts.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
